title: 'The Assignment Lifecycle — Quick Assessment Demo Session'
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU
url: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU/tree/main/mlu/professional-student-development/mlu-000005-quick-assessment-demos
abstract: >-
  A 90-minute facilitated session that walks a room through one assignment's full
  lifecycle — write the rubric, stress-test it, grade against it, and triage submissions
  before the deadline. Built around a single fluent, confident, and wrong student paper
  that earns a B+ under a vague rubric and an F under a rubric that names what correct
  means. Ships a deck, a talk track, a participant handout, and a five-student sample
  pack.
authors:
